{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CevJ5VQjuMzzBZxaWR14Q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll move to the design phase:\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DESIGN>>\n```\n\n**Analysis Summary:**\n- Requirement: Add `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` that transitions CREATED→CONFIRMED, idempotent for CONFIRMED, rejects CANCELLED with 409, rejects missing with 404\n- Repository findings:\n  - ShipmentController.kt:21-56 — REST controller with POST/GET/GET list\n  - ShipmentRepository.kt — in-memory store with save, findById, existsById\n  - Shipment.kt:23-27 — ShipmentStatus enum (CREATED, CONFIRMED, CANCELLED)\n  - ApiExceptions.kt:18-24 — ResourceNotFoundException, ConflictException\n  - ApiError.kt:31-37 — ErrorCode enum (needs new error code for shipment state conflict)\n  - GlobalExceptionHandler.kt:16-28 — centralized exception handling\n  - ShipmentControllerTest.kt — test patterns using MockMvc\n- Conventions:\n  - Exceptions thrown in controllers/services, caught by GlobalExceptionHandler\n  - Error responses use envelope with code, message, fields\n  - Tests use MockMvc with MockMvcRequestBuilders\n  - BeforeEach clears repository\n- No service layer; logic goes in controller\n- Exception handling is centralized; I just throw exceptions\n\n**Proposed Change:**\n\n1. **ApiError.kt** — Add new error code `SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM` for the 409 case (attempting to confirm a CANCELLED shipment)\n2. **ShipmentController.kt** — Add new method:\n   ```\n   @PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")\n   fun confirm(@PathVariable shipmentId: String): ResponseEntity<Shipment>\n   ```\n   - Find shipment or throw ResourceNotFoundException with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND\n   - If status is CREATED: update to CONFIRMED, save, return 200 OK\n   - If status is CONFIRMED: return 200 OK (idempotent, no change needed)\n   - If status is CANCELLED: throw ConflictException with SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM, returns 409\n3. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Add tests:\n   - Test confirming a CREATED shipment (transitions to CONFIRMED)\n   - Test confirming an already CONFIRMED shipment (idempotent, succeeds)\n   - Test confirming a CANCELLED shipment (409 conflict)\n   - Test confirming a non-existent shipment (404 not found)\n\n**Alternative Rejected:**\n- Could create a separate ShipmentService layer — but the existing code has no service layer and ticket says \"preserve existing architecture\", so controller logic is correct\n\n**Data and Error Flow:**\n\nCase 1: CREATED → CONFIRMED\n- Read: repository.findById(shipmentId) returns Shipment with status=CREATED\n- Write: repository.save(shipment.copy(status=CONFIRMED))\n- Return: 200 OK with updated Shipment\n\nCase 2: CONFIRMED → CONFIRMED (idempotent)\n- Read: repository.findById(shipmentId) returns Shipment with status=CONFIRMED\n- Write: nothing (already confirmed)\n- Return: 200 OK with Shipment (unchanged)\n\nCase 3: CANCELLED (conflict)\n- Read: repository.findById(shipmentId) returns Shipment with status=CANCELLED\n- Throw: ConflictException(ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM, message) → caught by GlobalExceptionHandler → 409 Conflict response\n\nCase 4: Non-existent\n- Read: repository.findById(shipmentId) returns null\n- Throw: ResourceNotFoundException(ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND, message) → caught by GlobalExceptionHandler → 404 Not Found response\n\n**Test Strategy:**\n- Test 1: Create shipment, confirm it, verify status=CONFIRMED in response, verify it's saved in repo\n- Test 2: Create shipment, confirm it twice, second confirm should succeed with same response\n- Test 3: Create shipment, manually set status=CANCELLED in repo, confirm should return 409 with SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM error code\n- Test 4: Confirm non-existent shipment, should return 404 with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND error code\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:IMPLEMENTATION>>\n```\n\nNow I'll implement the changes. First, add the error code:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":508,"cache_read_input_tokens":14824,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":508},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5fd1d437-4022-47fd-9f4b-44e7cb035a77","uuid":"91047584-1738-47cb-ac7a-09d949b75a9d","timestamp":"2026-09-10T19:16:36.600Z","request_id":"req_011CevJ5UjohkXvF6ZEfkS8M"}
