thods\n   - Why: Verify the new endpoint behavior for all cases (CREATED→CONFIRMED, idempotent, CANCELLED rejection, 404)\n   - Necessary: Yes, ticket requires testing acceptance criteria\n\n**Unresolved Findings:**\n\nNone. All requirements are addressed:\n- CREATED→CONFIRMED transitions work\n- CONFIRMED is idempotent (returns 200 OK unchanged)\n- CANCELLED returns 409 Conflict\n- Missing shipments return 404 Not Found\n- Error responses follow API contract (error code in envelope)\n- All existing functionality preserved\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\nRequirement   Add `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint that transitions CREATED shipments to CONFIRMED, treats CONFIRMED as idempotent, rejects CANCELLED with 409, and missing with 404\nChanged       ApiError.kt: added SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM error code for conflict cases\n              ShipmentController.kt: added confirm() method implementing the endpoint with status-based routing\n              ShipmentControllerTest.kt: added 4 tests covering CREATED→CONFIRMED, idempotent CONFIRMED, CANCELLED rejection, 404 for missing\nTests         `confirms a CREATED shipment and transitions it to CONFIRMED`: verify state change and persistence\n              `confirming an already CONFIRMED shipment succeeds and changes nothing`: verify idempotency\n              `confirming a CANCELLED shipment is rejected with 409`: verify conflict error code\n              `confirming an unknown shipment is rejected with 404`: verify 404 error code\nVerification  Command: `./mvnw test` from sample-service/\n              Result: BUILD SUCCESS, 17 tests run (5 existing + 4 new + 8 other), 0 failures\nNot done      nothing"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3350,"cache_read_input_tokens":18855,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3350},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","infere